`objAt`). Each is `ObjectMeta`'s accessor (`Spec/k8s_io/apimachinery/pkg/apis/meta/v1/`, a hypothesis
`hget`/`hset`) on the object's embedded `ObjectMeta`, reached by the API type's promoted method (a
goose-generated wrapper). Generated by a script of the phase-3 work (one case per resource);
Lean-first (no Rocq counterpart).

* `X_own_meta`: an API object's deep ownership is its metadata's and the rest's (a lens);
* `meta_own_base`: the metadata's basic fields are the deep value's;
* `meta_own_set_F`: setting a basic field sets the deep value's;
